# The repo owns its line endings: every text file is LF, in the repo AND in the
# working tree, on every machine — this overrides any local core.autocrlf. Modern
# editors and toolchains on Windows are fine with LF; Biome/CI check for it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
